REPLACE_WITH_THE_CONTENTS_OF_YOUR_REAL_PEM_FILE

This is a placeholder. Copy the folder and replace this file with the key that
reaches your server:

    cp -r .example/private_ssh_aws private_ssh_aws

Then `chmod 600 private_ssh_aws/ec2-ssh-key.pem`. private_ssh_aws/ is gitignored,
so the real key is never committed.
